This product is based on the Common Docs documentation specification created by
Christopher Skene. DocKitty adapts the Common Docs convention (specification
v1.2) into an Astro + Starlight toolkit — the "Kitty variation." DocKitty is an
independent project and is neither affiliated with nor endorsed by the Common
Docs project or Christopher Skene.

Upstream: https://github.com/velvet-tiger/common-docs (specification v1.2)

